<div class="top"><div class="wrap"><span>Welcome to Aman Private School</span><div><a href="tel:+93700000000">+93 700 000 000</a><a href="mailto:info@amanschool.edu.af">info@amanschool.edu.af</a></div></div></div>
<header class="header"><nav class="wrap nav"><a class="brand" href="#home"><img src="/aman-logo.svg" alt="Aman Private School logo"><span>Aman Private School<small>Learn. Grow. Succeed.</small></span></a><button class="menu" aria-label="Open menu">☰</button><div class="links"><a href="#home">Home</a><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#programs">Programs</a><a href="#admission">Admissions</a><a href="#news">News</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a><a class="button" href="{{ route('login.portal') }}">Login Portal</a></div></nav></header>
<main>
<section id="home" class="hero"><div class="hero-content"><span class="tag">Admissions Open for the New Academic Year</span><h1>Where learning becomes a brighter future.</h1><p>Aman Private School gives every learner a safe, caring and modern place to discover their potential.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="#admission">Admission Information</a><a class="button outline" href="#about">Discover Aman</a></div></div></section>
<div class="quick"><div class="wrap quick-grid"><a href="#admission"><b>✎ Online Admission</b><span>Start your application today</span></a><a href="{{ route('login.portal') }}"><b>▣ Student Portal</b><span>Results, attendance and homework</span></a><a href="#news"><b>◷ School News</b><span>Updates and announcements</span></a><a href="#contact"><b>⌖ Contact Aman</b><span>We are here to help</span></a></div></div>
<section id="about"><div class="wrap about"><div class="school-image" aria-label="Aman Private School campus"></div><div><p class="eyebrow">About Aman</p><h2>Education rooted in values and ambition.</h2><p class="muted">Aman Private School supports the academic, personal and social growth of every child. We help learners build confidence, develop skills and prepare for a successful future.</p><ul class="checks"><li>Experienced teachers</li><li>Safe learning environment</li><li>Modern teaching methods</li><li>Active parent partnership</li></ul><div class="stats"><div class="stat"><b>1,000+</b><span>Students</span></div><div class="stat"><b>60+</b><span>Teachers</span></div><div class="stat"><b>12</b><span>Grades</span></div></div></div></div></section>
<section id="programs" class="programs"><div class="wrap"><div class="head"><p class="eyebrow">Learning at Aman</p><h2>Helping students thrive at every stage.</h2><p class="muted">Well-rounded learning opportunities from the first steps in school to graduation.</p></div><div class="cards"><article class="card"><div class="icon">⌂</div><h3>Primary Education</h3><p>Strong foundations in literacy, numeracy and essential learning skills.</p></article><article class="card"><div class="icon">▤</div><h3>Secondary Education</h3><p>Focused academic preparation for the next stage of each learner's journey.</p></article><article class="card"><div class="icon">⚗</div><h3>Science & Technology</h3><p>Practical learning, curiosity and the skills needed for tomorrow.</p></article><article class="card"><div class="icon">◉</div><h3>Values Education</h3><p>Respect, responsibility and good character at the heart of school life.</p></article><article class="card"><div class="icon">♟</div><h3>Sports & Arts</h3><p>Creativity, health, teamwork and confidence beyond the classroom.</p></article><article class="card"><div class="icon">☁</div><h3>Digital Services</h3><p>Online attendance, results and simple communication for families.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section id="admission" class="admission"><div class="wrap admission-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow" style="color:#83ebca">Admissions</p><h2>Take the first step toward your child's success.</h2><p style="color:#d5e3ed">Our admission process is simple and clear. Contact Aman Private School for more information.</p><div class="steps"><div class="step"><b>1</b>Complete the admission form.</div><div class="step"><b>2</b>Submit the required documents.</div><div class="step"><b>3</b>Receive your admission confirmation.</div></div></div><aside class="admission-card"><h3>Admissions are open</h3><p>Registration is open from kindergarten through Grade 12.</p><p><b>Required documents:</b><br>ID copy, four photographs and previous school record.</p><a class="button" href="tel:+93700000000">Call Aman Today</a></aside></div></section>
<section id="news"><div class="wrap"><div class="head"><p class="eyebrow">Latest from Aman</p><h2>Stay connected with school life.</h2><p class="muted">Recent activities, important dates and announcements from Aman Private School.</p></div><div class="news"><article><div class="news-image"></div><div><time>NEW ACADEMIC YEAR</time><h3>A warm welcome to our new Aman families</h3><p>We look forward to a year of learning, growth and achievement together.</p></div></article><article><div class="news-image"></div><div><time>ANNOUNCEMENT</time><h3>Monthly parent meeting</h3><p>Join us to discuss student progress and school activities.</p></div></article><article><div class="news-image"></div><div><time>ACADEMIC</time><h3>Exam schedule available</h3><p>Students and parents can view the schedule through the portal.</p></div></article></div></div></section>
<section id="contact" class="contact"><div class="wrap contact-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Contact Aman</p><h2>We are ready to answer your questions.</h2><p class="muted">Contact Aman Private School for admissions, academic information or support.</p><div class="contact-list"><div class="contact-item"><b>Phone</b><span>+93 700 000 000</span></div><div class="contact-item"><b>Email</b><span>info@amanschool.edu.af</span></div><div class="contact-item"><b>Address</b><span>Kabul, Afghanistan</span></div></div></div><aside class="portal"><h3>Aman Online Portal</h3><p>Students, parents and teachers can securely access their information online.</p><a href="{{ route('login.portal') }}">Student Portal →</a><a href="{{ route('login.portal') }}">Parent Portal →</a><a href="{{ route('login.portal') }}">Teacher Portal →</a></aside></div></section>
